# ⚠️ Storage Account Name Important

Azure Storage Account name:

* globally unique होना चाहिए
* lowercase होना चाहिए
* spaces नहीं होने चाहिए
* special characters नहीं होने चाहिए

इसलिए static name रखने के बजाय हम unique suffix generate कर सकते हैं।

---

# 🚀 Deployment YAML

```yaml
trigger:
- main

pool:
  vmImage: ubuntu-latest

steps:

- task: AzureCLI@2
  displayName: "Deploy Azure Storage Account"
  inputs:
    azureSubscription: "sc-axion-azure"
    scriptType: bash
    scriptLocation: inlineScript
    inlineScript: |

      RESOURCE_GROUP="rg-axion-devops-lab"
      LOCATION="eastus"

      STORAGE_ACCOUNT="axiondevops$(date +%s)"

      echo "Resource Group: $RESOURCE_GROUP"
      echo "Location: $LOCATION"
      echo "Storage Account: $STORAGE_ACCOUNT"

      echo "===== Creating Storage Account ====="

      az storage account create \
        --name "$STORAGE_ACCOUNT" \
        --resource-group "$RESOURCE_GROUP" \
        --location "$LOCATION" \
        --sku Standard_LRS \
        --allow-blob-public-access false

      echo "===== Verifying Storage Account ====="

      az storage account show \
        --name "$STORAGE_ACCOUNT" \
        --resource-group "$RESOURCE_GROUP" \
        --output table
```

