# 🛠️ Intentional Failure Test

अब एक बहुत useful troubleshooting exercise करेंगे।

मान लो Service Principal के पास Resource Group में permission नहीं है।

तब:

```text
Authentication
      ↓
      ✅
Authorization
      ↓
      ❌
```

Pipeline Azure तक पहुँच सकती है लेकिन resource operation fail होगा।

इससे हमें difference practically समझ आएगा:

```text
Authentication successful
+
Authorization failed
```

यह production troubleshooting में बहुत important है।

---

# 🔍 Failure Matrix

| Error Situation              | Possible Area               |
| ---------------------------- | --------------------------- |
| Service Connection not found | ADO configuration           |
| WIF token error              | Entra/WIF                   |
| Authentication failed        | Identity/Service Connection |
| AuthorizationFailed          | Azure RBAC                  |
| Resource Group not found     | Resource/Scope              |
| Storage name unavailable     | Global naming               |
| Agent unavailable            | Agent/Pool                  |
| Pipeline waiting             | Parallel jobs/capacity      |
| Azure CLI command failed     | CLI/resource configuration  |

